MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Implements the gateway-local quiet proof (QUIET-V2 decisions as scoped by the V3 service-scope disposition):

- hermes_cli/local_work{,_threads}.py: one stdlib-only process registry with a continuous activity epoch/count,
  sticky unknowns, per-home membership and scopes. Work reserves BEFORE scheduling and releases only at the
  physical target's outermost finally (TrackedThread, ScopeAwareExecutor, submit_tracked), never on caller
  cancel/timeout/join(timeout). Passive maintenance never reserves and is never suppressed.
- Local seams: agent turns, auxiliary/provider calls (protected daemon), memory provider threads, tool dispatch,
  code-kernel RPC handlers and late callbacks, MCP loop, delegation, managed session workers, adapter ingress,
  TUI JSON-RPC and authority-path verbs (shared passive/work classification), plugin host, api_server turn
  executor, startup/producer/kanban/delegation sweepers, cron run_one_job, Desktop voice routes, PTY children,
  kanban dispatcher worker children (pid+birth custody).
- agent/claim_quiet*.py, hermes_platform/quiet_clock.py: root-scoped exclusive claim-quiet lease (<=480 s, no
  renewal, 2 h cooldown committed before the lease, crash/unlock/expiry reopen admission).
- Gates only automatic local Kanban claims and already-classified FIFO kanban-wake execution; users, cron,
  fallbacks, notifications, updates, timers and sync keep running. Quiet reason is separate from updater drain;
  updater behavior unchanged.
- gateway/quiet_control.py + hermes_cli/kanban_quiet.py + scripts/observe_gateway_quiet.py: control verbs and an
  attended observer measuring the exact gateway PID's cumulative CPU (observer overhead included, never
  subtracted); epoch movement, active work, original predicates, unknown coverage or update collision invalidate.
- hermes_cli/code_attestation.py + hermes_bootstrap: audit-hook executed-code attestation from a finite trusted
  seed on the managed launch route; dependency bytes trusted only by installer RECORD receipt (reported
  separately, never audited, no coverage); reviewed finite generator descriptors (dataclasses, namedtuple,
  annotationlib.ForwardRef.evaluate, typing_inspection); every other unrooted/unknown code path fails closed.

Not a live CPU pass: natural rollout and the attended >=300 s proof remain with the parent card.
